For Loop

Syntax

            1           2       4 
for (initialization;condtion;update) {   - the update is the counter 
     statement(s); //body 3 
}

Execution Order -> initialization -> condtion (t) -> Body 
                -> Update -> Condition ->
                
Program Tracing
- You need to follow what is happening inside the loop

iteration       i        test        condition       action      update
1               1       i <=5          true            1           2 
2               2       i <=5          true            2           3 
3               3       i <=5          true            3           4 
4               4       i <=5          true            4           5
5               5       i <=5          true            5           6 
6               6       i <=5          false          stop 
*******************************************************************************/
